'''Team Secret''' is a [[:Category:Europe|European]] esports organization , originally founded as a ''[[:dota2:Team_Secret|Dota 2]]'' team in the wake of [[Dota2:The International 2014|The International 2014]]. The ''[[Main Page|VALORANT]]'' division was founded in September 2021 by signing the former squad of [[Bren Esports]].

